00:00:41.359 --> 00:00:43.022
- This is "Ravenclaw;" it's blue.

00:00:43.022 --> 00:00:43.872
- It has to be "Ravenclaw."
- [Eugene] It's a dark blue.

00:00:43.872 --> 00:00:44.674
It has to be "Ravenclaw."

00:00:44.674 --> 00:00:47.350
- Like, the good version of Bellatrix.

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:49.243
So, that would be Sirius.

00:00:50.313 --> 00:00:51.693
- Seriously?

00:00:51.693 --> 00:00:52.680
"Sirius?"

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.510
- Sirius!
- [Ned] Yay!

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:57.339
- Ooh, I like this color.

00:00:57.339 --> 00:00:58.462
It's like blood.

00:00:58.462 --> 00:00:59.295
- It's a nice red.

00:00:59.295 --> 00:01:00.859
- It's very deep, it's a fall.

00:01:00.859 --> 00:01:01.516
- Yes!

00:01:01.516 --> 00:01:02.733
- Definitely "Bellatrix."

00:01:02.733 --> 00:01:05.477
It looks like I have
chocolate all over my mouth.

00:01:06.707 --> 00:01:07.975
- No.

00:01:07.975 --> 00:01:10.122
- Someone cast a spell on this right now.

00:01:10.122 --> 00:01:11.097
- This? No!

00:01:11.097 --> 00:01:11.485
I don't--

00:01:11.485 --> 00:01:12.148
- No, no.

00:01:12.148 --> 00:01:12.852
- I disagree.

00:01:12.852 --> 00:01:13.188
- Yup.

00:01:13.188 --> 00:01:13.799
- Nope.

00:01:13.799 --> 00:01:14.814
- Wholeheartedly.

00:01:14.814 --> 00:01:15.800
- Delete spell.

00:01:17.307 --> 00:01:21.176
- Do you feel sad or do you feel evil?

00:01:21.176 --> 00:01:22.856
- I feel evil with this, yeah.

00:01:22.856 --> 00:01:24.660
- It definitely reads darker on your lips,

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:26.965
which is what I was hoping
for for "Bellatrix."

00:01:26.965 --> 00:01:27.984
- It's very dark.

00:01:27.984 --> 00:01:29.573
It's very witchy.

00:01:29.573 --> 00:01:32.742
- I can't help but think
it looks like a mustache.

00:01:34.477 --> 00:01:34.950
- Yay!

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:36.014
- Oh, great!

00:01:36.014 --> 00:01:37.392
- [Together] Yeah!

00:01:37.392 --> 00:01:38.184
- Haha!

00:01:39.494 --> 00:01:41.687
