00:01:41.687 --> 00:01:42.807
has got to be

00:01:42.807 --> 00:01:43.825
Slytherin.
- [Ned] Hermione.

00:01:43.825 --> 00:01:44.547
No.

00:01:44.547 --> 00:01:46.295
