00:01:46.295 --> 00:01:49.417
- It's got the shimmer to it,
so it's got the scaly effect.

00:01:49.417 --> 00:01:51.550
- This makes me feel different,

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:53.562
which, I think, is part
of being Slytherin,

00:01:53.562 --> 00:01:56.289
and part of Voldemort's crew.

00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:58.901
Did we even check that we got it?

00:01:58.901 --> 00:01:59.883
- Yeah, of course we got it right.

00:01:59.883 --> 00:02:00.715
- Course we got it right.

00:02:00.715 --> 00:02:01.400
- Duh.

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:01.972
- Duh.

00:02:02.903 --> 00:02:04.896
- Could have made one
for each of the houses.

00:02:04.896 --> 00:02:05.418
- Mm hmm.

00:02:05.418 --> 00:02:07.006
- You know, because yes,
there's a "Ravenclaw,"

00:02:07.006 --> 00:02:09.104
but I'm a Hufflepuff, what
am I supposed to wear?

00:02:09.104 --> 00:02:10.517
- It makes me feel different,

00:02:10.517 --> 00:02:12.406
and I feel like that's what
being a witch and a wizard

00:02:12.406 --> 00:02:13.191
is all about,

00:02:13.191 --> 00:02:14.768
is being different.

00:02:14.768 --> 00:02:16.968
- Changes the way you
think about yourself.

00:02:16.968 --> 00:02:18.410
- "Always."

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:23.287
- My final thoughts are
(speaks Parseltongue).

00:02:25.337 --> 00:02:25.959
(hisses)

00:02:26.855 --> 00:02:27.768
- Avada Kedavra.

00:02:27.768 --> 00:02:29.161
What, I said it.

00:02:29.161 --> 00:02:31.617
Death lasts forever, so does this makeup.

